<h2>Desktops</h2>
<p>Desktop Macs range from the M4's 10-core GPU in the iMac and Mac mini up to the M3 Ultra's 80-core GPU in the Mac Studio. The M4 Max in the Mac Studio is the sweet spot for serious gaming—its 40-core GPU outperforms the base M4 by roughly 3× in GPU TFLOPS. The Mac Pro's M2 Ultra remains powerful but is a generation behind on ray tracing efficiency.</p>

